{"id": "36734", "title": "流星蝴蝶剑", "author": "古龙", "category": "文学名著", "count": 29, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/36/36734/36734s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/36/36734.htm", "intro": "流星的光芒虽短促，但天上还有什么星能比它更灿烂，辉煌\r\n\r\n当流星出现的时候，就算是永恒不变的星座，也夺不去它的光\r\n\r\n蝴蝶的生命是脆弱的甚至比鲜艳的花还脆弱。\r\n\r\n可是它永远是活在春天里。\r\n\r\n它美丽，它自由，它飞翔。\r\n\r\n它的生命虽短促却芬芳。\r\n\r\n只有剑，才比较接近永恒。", "base": "files/article/html/36/36734", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "一", "file": "2840586.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "2840587.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "2840588.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "2840589.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "2840590.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "2840591.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "2840592.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "2840593.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "2840594.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三", "file": "2840595.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一O", "file": "2840596.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一四", "file": "2840597.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一一", "file": "2840598.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五", "file": "2840599.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一二", "file": "2840600.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一六", "file": "2840601.html", "available": false}, {"title": "一七", "file": "2840602.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二一", "file": "2840603.html", "available": true}, {"title": "一八", "file": "2840604.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二二", "file": "2840605.html", "available": true}, {"title": "一九", "file": "2840606.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二三", "file": "2840607.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二十", "file": "2840608.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二四", "file": "2840609.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二五", "file": "2840610.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二